[{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0028","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0028.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0844","title":"CVSD CVSD 1.11.2之前版本 CVS PreservePermissions off-by-one溢出代码执行漏洞","description":"CVSD 1.11.2 之前版本的 CVS PreservePermissions 功能在 rcs.c 中存在越界写入漏洞（CWE-193），本地低权限攻击者可通过构造特制的 CVS 请求触发 rcs.c 中 PreservePermissions 函数的越界写入，导致栈缓冲区溢出，进而在本地提权执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 CVSD 1.11.2 之前所有版本，CVSS 3.1 评分 7.8（HIGH），攻击向量为本地、低攻击复杂度、低权限、无需用户交互，机密性/完整性/可用性影响均为高。攻击者需具备本地系统访问权限并能调用 CVS 相关功能，通过精心构造的参数触发 rcs.c 中 PreservePermissions 函数的 off-by-one 溢出，覆盖关键栈数据实现任意代码执行。CVSD 1.11.2 已修复此漏洞，建议升级至 1.11.2 或更高版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0844"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:15Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 CVSD 到 1.11.2 或更高版本，该版本已修复 rcs.c 中 PreservePermissions 的越界写入漏洞。若无法立即升级，可暂时禁用 CVSD 的 PreservePermissions 功能或限制本地用户对 CVS 仓库的写入权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2002-q2/0081.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102233767925177&w=2","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2004-004.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4829","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/9175","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ea93936438a97f1459a1dd6e83719dbfc798be2/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0844.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0844","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4a364075e0f1d18be5590f7700d143d985f1789f/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0844.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/cf9f26fab3bbc76af663e922f8ccf4da465b1866/2002/CVE-2002-0844.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0844.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1b97942de7f8736fb9dac77c314951b8b2cd2867/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0844.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0844.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/464c797de515f2d88fce07a24f8ad97207296c93/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-0844.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/5ff0b9e6ad0b51b419967392a23ca6a8c4176810/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-08xx/CVE-2002-0844.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0844.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0028.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0025","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0025.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0825","title":"nss_ldap DNS SRV 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"nss_ldap 的 DNS SRV 记录解析代码存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，在 nss_ldap-198 之前版本中，远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的 DNS SRV 响应触发该漏洞，导致目标服务崩溃引发拒绝服务，甚至可能实现任意代码执行。该漏洞影响所有使用 nss_ldap 且未升级到 198 版本的 Linux/Unix 系统，攻击者无需认证即可远程触发。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0825"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:12Z","remediation":"立即升级 nss_ldap 至 198 或更高版本（libnss-ldap 包对应 Debian 修复版本为 199-1）。在 Red Hat Enterprise Linux 中通过 `yum update nss_ldap` 更新，Debian/Ubuntu 通过 `apt-get update && apt-get install libnss-ldap` 更新。如无法立即升级，可在防火墙限制对 LDAP 服务器的访问来源 IP，并监控 DNS SRV 查询流量异常。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.padl.com/Articles/PotentialBufferOverflowin.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ea93936438a97f1459a1dd6e83719dbfc798be2/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0825.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a237fbd576a7286b31323c79c10e5d8ddb9ad316/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0825.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0825","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0825.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0825.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/5ff0b9e6ad0b51b419967392a23ca6a8c4176810/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-08xx/CVE-2002-0825.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/9dff795a9a7b58dca025b22ebdb342ecc8354f50/2002/CVE-2002-0825.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ef1766e2b390160881db9b8bb9c1bb8bfb197a80/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0825.md","https://github.com/zercurity/vulnerabilities/blob/8eb5f158d91688a46557263c708774d5f8d3956c/2002/CVE-2002-0825","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/464c797de515f2d88fce07a24f8ad97207296c93/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-0825.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0025.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0024","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0024.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0817","title":"William Deich Super 3.x 格式字符串漏洞","description":"William Deich Super 3.x 的 SysLog 功能存在格式化字符串漏洞，本地攻击者可通过向 super 程序传递超长命令行参数触发该漏洞，利用格式化字符串缺陷覆盖内存关键数据，最终获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 Linux 系统上的 super 3.x 版本，攻击向量为本地（AV:L），攻击复杂度低（AC:L），无需身份认证（Au:N），可导致机密性、完整性、可用性完全丧失（C:C/I:C/A:C），CVSS 评分 7.2。攻击者需具备本地系统访问权限，通过构造恶意格式化字符串参数实现提权。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0817"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:11Z","remediation":"升级 Super 软件包到最新版本（至少 3.20 及以上），或者应用包含修复的系统安全更新（如 Debian DSA-0139），并确保系统仅允许授权用户运行 super 命令。在升级前如无法立即修复，建议通过修改 super 配置文件禁止匿名用户访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2002-q3/0045.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102812622416695&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-139","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9741.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5367","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21674","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2002/CVE-2002-0817.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0235c22e9b6c7ddb8ada469b545320bce3ffcbfa/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0817.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2002/CVE-2002-0817.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2002/CVE-2002-0817.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0817.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0817","https://github.com/zercurity/vulnerabilities/blob/8eb5f158d91688a46557263c708774d5f8d3956c/2002/CVE-2002-0817","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-0817.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0817.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0817.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0024.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0023","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0023.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0765","title":"OpenBSD OpenSSH 身份验证绕过漏洞","description":"OpenSSH 3.2.2 的 sshd 组件在使用 YP（NIS）和 netgroup 机制时存在认证实现缺陷。当系统配置了基于 YP 的 netgroup 访问控制时，在某些特定条件下，远程攻击者能够使用其他用户的密码通过身份验证并成功登录目标系统，导致认证绕过。该漏洞影响 OpenSSH 3.2.2 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高，攻击者无需事先认证即可利用此漏洞获取系统非授权访问。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0765"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:05Z","remediation":"升级 OpenSSH 至 3.3 及以上版本，该漏洞在 OpenSSH 3.3 中已修复。如无法升级，可禁用 YP/NIS netgroups 认证方式，在 `/etc/ssh/sshd_config` 中设置 `UsePAM yes` 并移除 NIS netgroup 相关配置作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-05/0235.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9215.php","http://www.openbsd.org/errata.html#sshbsdauth","http://www.osvdb.org/5113","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4803","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/34b929f9979d6d9d9584dfab31f29f50dcf08e3f/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0765.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0765","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2002-0765.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4591185d8ea1fe47b6e30df3286bd52753a931ce/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0765.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-hw3r-x5qh-749j/GHSA-hw3r-x5qh-749j.json","https://github.com/zercurity/vulnerabilities/blob/8eb5f158d91688a46557263c708774d5f8d3956c/2002/CVE-2002-0765","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/O/openssh_33.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_148900_149000.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0765.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0023.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0022","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0022.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0740","title":"SLRN slrnpull 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"SLRN 软件包中的 slrnpull 组件存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。当 slrnpull 以 setuid 或 setgid 权限安装时，本地攻击者可通过向 -d（SPOOLDIR）参数传递超长字符串触发缓冲区溢出，从而获得提升的权限。该漏洞影响 SLRN 0.9.6 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，利用难度较低。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0740"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:02Z","remediation":"立即升级 SLRN 至 0.9.7.4 或更高版本（可从 SourceForge 获取），该版本修复了 slrnpull 的缓冲区溢出问题。如无法升级，作为临时缓解措施，移除 slrnpull 的 setuid/setgid 权限位（chmod u-s /usr/bin/slrnpull; chmod g-s /usr/bin/slrnpull），并限制仅受信任用户可本地访问系统。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-04/0302.html","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/269667","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/270235","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8910.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4569","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21408","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2002/CVE-2002-0740.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/57432302d64f9bc08597d61c88fc5f900569476d/2002/CVE-2002-0740.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2e429c9a0087eb0ee678d77c344076eb39564d19/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0740.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2002/CVE-2002-0740.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2002/CVE-2002-0740.md","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/23441ec855d45e03157b693d7c6d0ff023fe3af5/2002/CVE-2002-0740/README.md","https://github.com/ycdxsb/PocOrExp_in_Github/blob/226723f3c2e60028a9b1052bd4423ce200e39cc3/2002/README.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0740","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0740.json","https://github.com/0xT11/CVE-POC/blob/2b6f11c3712c0efb88ac3edeab3d0aafa1f7a090/2002/CVE-2002-0740.json","https://github.com/alt3kx/CVE-2002-0740"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0022.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0021","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0021.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0738","title":"MHonArc 邮件归档跨站脚本漏洞","description":"MHonArc 2.5.2 及更早版本的电子邮件归档功能未正确过滤邮件中的恶意 JavaScript 代码，存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。远程攻击者可通过构造特殊邮件，利用 SCRIPT 标签拆分、IMG 标签 SRC 属性注入或 `&={script}` 语法等方式绕过过滤，当其他用户查看归档邮件时触发恶意脚本执行。该漏洞影响 MHonArc 2.5.2 及之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。建议升级至更高版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0738"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:02Z","remediation":"升级 MHonArc 至 2.5.3 或更高版本（2.5.14 为安全修复版），Debian 用户安装对应安全更新（DSA-163）。如无法升级，在 MHonArc 配置中通过 MIMEEXCS 资源禁用 text/html 邮件处理以阻止 HTML 脚本执行，同时在 Web 服务器层面设置 Content-Security-Policy 头限制脚本加载作为纵深防御。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-04/0260.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-163","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8894.php","http://www.mhonarc.org/MHonArc/CHANGES","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4546","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/34b929f9979d6d9d9584dfab31f29f50dcf08e3f/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0738.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0738","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2002-0738.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/475f53ac063af305fc146a443cce993188109d56/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0738.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mqj3-hp36-pg28/GHSA-mqj3-hp36-pg28.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-163.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_600_700.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/2002/dsa-163.data","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0738.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0021.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0021.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0016","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0016.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0684","title":"GNU glibc DNS解析器缓冲区溢出代码执行漏洞","description":"glibc 2.2.5 及早期版本中移植的 BIND 4.9.8 DNS 解析器函数（如 getnetbyname、getnetbyaddr）存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程恶意 DNS 服务器可通过构造恶意 DNS 响应，触发这些函数中的子例程缓冲区溢出，实现远程任意代码执行。该漏洞影响使用受影响 glibc 版本的 Linux 系统及 BIND 4.9.8，攻击者需控制或欺骗受害者查询的 DNS 服务器，通过恶意网络名称/地址查询响应触发溢出，CVSS 7.5 分（高危），影响机密性、完整性和可用性。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0684"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:56Z","remediation":"升级 glibc 到 2.2.6 或以上版本，并升级 BIND 到 8.x 或 9.x 系列。具体修复措施包括：应用 glibc 的安全补丁以修复 DNS 解析器缓冲区溢出漏洞，更新 BIND 配置文件以正确验证 DNS 响应，禁用对不可信 DNS 服务器的递归查询，对于遗留系统请考虑使用 hardening 技术如文本化缓冲区处理和地址随机化作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000507","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102581482511612&w=2","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2002-139.html","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/542971","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2002/MDKSA-2002-050.php","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2002/CVE-2002-0029.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fc5c3e6f60accc24b7eac4fd31472f0e5fd97f24/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0684.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0