ecurity_center/static/9718.php","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/748355","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5366","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/23199","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2002/CVE-2002-0659.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/03dbfc069b6c638678ff904c80e89aaf72b93764/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0659.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2002/CVE-2002-0659.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0659","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/3a751de84316f1f1910c7d0a918a0e2c4180a6d3/CVEs/2002/CVE-2002-0659.md","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-0659.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03a7e425813b5ae0ce33712378801e4e929dbdb7/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0659.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2002/CVE-2002-0659.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/2720049fa2ff0728cf5af8a5d5207201a53780f6/2002/CVE-2002-0659.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/84bee56eebc672b008a8b9d6058ddea66387743b/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0659.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0014.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0013","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0013.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0658","title":"OSSP mm 共享内存库临时文件权限提升漏洞","description":"OSSP mm 共享内存库（libmm）1.2.0 之前版本在处理临时文件时存在符号链接攻击漏洞。本地 Apache 用户可通过创建恶意的符号链接指向系统关键文件，诱使 libmm 以提升的权限操作这些临时文件，从而获取更高权限。攻击条件为拥有本地 Apache 用户访问权限，利用方式简单，危害较大，可导致本地权限提升。建议升级至 libmm 1.2.0 或更高版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.2,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0658"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:53Z","remediation":"升级 OSSP mm library (libmm) 至 1.2.0 或更高版本，该版本修复了临时文件创建中的竞态条件问题。如无法立即升级，确保 Apache 用户对临时目录（如 /tmp）的写入权限受到严格限制，并启用文件系统保护机制（如设置 sticky bit）防止符号链接攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://online.securityfocus.com/advisories/4392","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2002-153.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2002-154.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2002-156.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2002-164.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-137","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9719.php","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2002/MDKSA-2002-045.php","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2002_028_mod_ssl.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-163.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-158.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5352","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21667","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/03dbfc069b6c638678ff904c80e89aaf72b93764/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0658.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0658","https://github.com/zercurity/vulnerabilities/blob/8eb5f158d91688a46557263c708774d5f8d3956c/2002/CVE-2002-0658","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03a7e425813b5ae0ce33712378801e4e929dbdb7/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0658.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/bc6988a2a044e68837754c12506c5490595b4bd3/2002/CVE-2002-0658.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0658.json","https://github.com/greenbone/openvas-scanner/blob/2c9b7ee74828aed29c069ad2a5fe87504eb0b0d9/rust/examples/feed/notus/advisories/windows.notus","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/84bee56eebc672b008a8b9d6058ddea66387743b/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0658.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0658.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/338375e9291959a955b9c4f1b7794c4836fe2985/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-0658.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0013.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0012","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0012.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0657","title":"OpenSSL 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"OpenSSL 0.9.7 至 0.9.7-beta3 版本在启用 Kerberos 支持时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。当处理过长的 master key 时，程序未正确验证输入长度，导致堆或栈缓冲区溢出。远程攻击者可通过向使用受影响 OpenSSL 版本的服务发送特制的 Kerberos 握手请求触发该漏洞，成功利用可实现任意代码执行，完全控制目标系统。该漏洞影响所有启用 Kerberos 的 OpenSSL 0.9.7 系列版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0657"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:52Z","remediation":"升级 OpenSSL 至 0.9.7-beta3 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，可在编译时禁用 Kerberos 支持（./configure --no-kerberos），消除缓冲区溢出攻击路径。对于生产环境，建议部署 WAF 规则拦截异常长度的 master key 请求作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000513","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2002-23.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9715.php","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/561275","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2002/MDKSA-2002-046.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5361","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2002/CVE-2002-0657.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/676b40fa5dad82f5f5be4cb920867579d5869c49/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0657.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2002/CVE-2002-0657.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0657","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/485b16e111d5be129c27a026bd0160d48eb6b893/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0657.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-0657.md","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/330e2fec91a211e725279f451969bfcde2b8b92d/CVEs/2002/CVE-2002-0657.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0657.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2002/CVE-2002-0657.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1838da7604055c8895f6f79e31255e78a27012a4/2002/CVE-2002-0657.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0012.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0011","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0011.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0656","title":"OpenSSL SSL2/SSL3 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"OpenSSL 0.9.6d 及之前版本、0.9.7-beta2 及之前版本中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过两种方式触发：一是向 SSL2 发送过大的客户端主密钥（KEY_ARG），二是向 SSL3 发送过大的会话 ID（Session ID），均导致缓冲区溢出，进而实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响所有使用受影响 OpenSSL 版本的 Web 服务器（如 Apache mod_ssl），攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络远程利用，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。厂商已发布 OpenSSL 0.9.6e 及 0.9.7-beta3 修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0656"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:52Z","remediation":"立即升级 OpenSSL 至 0.9.6e 或更高版本（0.9.6d 用户可打补丁 https://www.openssl.org/news/patch_20020730_0_9_6d.txt），0.9.7 预发布版用户升级至 0.9.7-beta3 或更高版本，并重新编译所有依赖 OpenSSL 的应用程序。临时缓解措施：在服务器上禁用 SSLv2 协议，在客户端完全禁用 SSL/TLS 功能直至补丁应用完毕。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000513","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2002-23.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9714.php","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9716.php","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/102795","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/258555","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2002/MDKSA-2002-046.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5362","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5363","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/40347","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2002/CVE-2002-0656.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/03dbfc069b6c638678ff904c80e89aaf72b93764/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0656.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2002/CVE-2002-0656.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2002/CVE-2002-0656.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0656","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/3a751de84316f1f1910c7d0a918a0e2c4180a6d3/CVEs/2002/CVE-2002-0656.md","https://github.com/aw-junaid/Hacking-Tools/blob/62711d1b0ad3259f44b647a05da2680c094c9d6e/Worms/Slapper worm.md","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-0656.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03a7e425813b5ae0ce33712378801e4e929dbdb7/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0656.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2002/CVE-2002-0656.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0011.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0010","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0010.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0655","title":"OpenSSL 64位平台整数ASCII表示处理远程代码执行漏洞","description":"OpenSSL 0.9.6d 及更早版本、0.9.7-beta2 及更早版本在 64 位平台上处理整数的 ASCII 表示时存在缺陷，未能正确转换大整数，导致缓冲区溢出。远程攻击者无需认证即可向受影响服务发送特制数据触发该漏洞，造成拒绝服务，甚至可能执行任意代码。该漏洞影响大量使用 OpenSSL 的系统和应用，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0655"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:52Z","remediation":"升级到 OpenSSL 0.9.6e 或 0.9.7-beta3 及以上版本。各 Linux 发行版用户应安装厂商提供的安全更新：Red Hat 安装 RHSA-2002:155 补丁，Debian 安装 DSA-136 补丁，SuSE 安装 SuSE-SA:2002:027 补丁。Apple Mac OS X 用户应安装 Apple 发布的安全更新。如无法立即升级，可在网络边界限制对受影响服务的访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000513","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2002-23.html","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/308891","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2002/MDKSA-2002-046.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5364","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2002/CVE-2002-0655.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/676b40fa5dad82f5f5be4cb920867579d5869c49/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0655.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2002/CVE-2002-0655.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0655","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-0655.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/9e840c51f12aff4a18b8c50d63ae898b6e33f403/references/CVE-2002-0655-2023-09-21-1730","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/485b16e111d5be129c27a026bd0160d48eb6b893/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0655.json","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/330e2fec91a211e725279f451969bfcde2b8b92d/CVEs/2002/CVE-2002-0655.md","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2002/CVE-2002-0655.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/9841ac21d9bcdb7f48d8ef999473e1abd131d5fe/2002/CVE-2002-0655.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0010.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0004","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0004.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0391","title":"Sun RPC XDR库xdr_array函数整数溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Sun RPC 实现中的 xdr_array 函数存在整数溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向运行 RPC 服务的系统（如 rpc.cmsd 和 dmispd）发送大量参数的恶意 RPC 请求触发该漏洞，导致缓冲区溢出，进而实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响使用基于 SunRPC 代码的 libc、glibc 及 dietlibc 等库的操作系统，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。攻击无需身份认证，利用复杂度低，影响系统机密性、完整性和可用性。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0391"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:20Z","remediation":"Linux 系统应升级 glibc 至 2.2.5-12（Debian）或安装 RHSA-2002-166（Red Hat）；MIT Kerberos 5 升级至 krb5-1.2.6 或打补丁 MITKRB5-SA-2002-001；OpenAFS 升级至 1.2.6；FreeBSD 安装 SA-02:34 补丁；NetBSD 升级至 1.6 或打 SA2002-011 补丁；OpenBSD 应用 012_xdr 补丁；Apple Mac OS X 安装 Security Update 2002-08-23；Windows 安装 MS02-057 补丁（仅 Services for Unix 3.0）。临时缓解措施：禁用不必要的 RPC 服务（如 rpc.cmsd、dmispd、kadmind），在防火墙上封锁 RPC 端口 111/TCP 和 111/UDP。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/aix/2002-q4/0002.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-07/0514.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/hp/2002-q3/0077.html","http://bvlive01.iss.net/issEn/delivery/xforce/alertdetail.jsp?oid=20823","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000515","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000535","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102813809232532&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102821785316087&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102821928418261&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102831443208382&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103158632831416&w=2","http://online.securityfocus.com/advisories/4402","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/285740","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2002-166.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2002-172.html","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2002-25.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-142","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-143","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-146","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-149","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-333","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9170.php","http://www.kb.