po_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0004.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0440","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0440.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0783","title":"Opera 浏览器同源政策绕过漏洞","description":"Opera 5.12 及 6.0 版本浏览器存在同源策略绕过漏洞。由于浏览器未能正确限制跨域框架（frame）的 location 属性访问，远程攻击者可以构造恶意网页，诱使用户访问后，通过操作内嵌框架的 location 对象绕过同源策略限制，从而读取或修改其他域下的页面内容，导致敏感信息泄露。攻击者无需任何身份认证，仅需用户使用受影响版本浏览器访问恶意页面即可触发。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0783"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-08-12T00:00:00Z","updated":"2002-08-12T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 Opera 浏览器至 6.01 或更高版本，该漏洞已在后续版本中修复。由于 Opera 5.12 和 6.0 均已停止支持，建议卸载旧版本并安装受支持的现代浏览器（如最新版 Chrome、Firefox 或 Edge）。如因特殊环境无法升级，可在浏览器设置中禁用 JavaScript 作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21451","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0661b1b09ba7a2e855981f4a1781f3b8de7cf562/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0783.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0783","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0783.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0783.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0783.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/65a328502a723ec4191dc80b53c8c169dc6165eb/2002/CVE-2002-0783.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c80cd921505a9f88e4aae41f1414ac3763e708ba/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0783.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3a7c0c4aa01967d2633d808f80f3fcd65491b947/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-07xx/CVE-2002-0783.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0783.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve